{
 "brief": "Shehab Wire marked the first anniversary of the death of Al Jazeera correspondent Anas al-Sharif, who was killed alongside five other journalists in an Israeli airstrike on August 10, 2025. The strike targeted a tent housing the reporters at Shifa medical complex in Gaza City, destroying the shelter where the media workers were positioned.\n\nThe five journalists killed with al-Sharif were identified as Muhammad Quraiqea, Ibrahim Zahir, Muhammad Nofal, Muomen Alioua, and Muhammad al-Khalidi. All six died in the single airstrike that hit the hospital compound during the conflict in Gaza. The deaths marked a significant loss for international news coverage of the territory.",
